    2. Place 2-3 non-overlapping rectangular frames of frame_color. Make one uniquely largest (6-8 per side, area gap >=12 from second-largest). Smaller frames 3-5 per side.
    3. Inside the largest frame interior, place 2-4 marker_color pixels on random bg cells.
